urs I locate  the noise maker send them a letter and  ask for compliance this matter is urgent  within ten years it's likely that there  will be no quiet places left unless we  take action when I first started I did  not think silence would go extinct in my  lifetime  and if that happens the quiet will  disappear and the wildlife will be  devastated the one square inch of  silence foundation is pressing our  politicians to pass a single piece of  legislation that will designate Olympic  National Park as the world's first quiet  park off-limits to aircraft all things  are possible the earth is here and it's  beautiful and for me it all starts here  in the whole valley a plank I've came up  with the largest collection of old  American cars in the world  you know all of them have the story but  they kindly take their place in the  forest you know and they're part of the  forest  they grew up partially in the forest  [Music]  my name is Walter Dean Lewis  I've run and operated on hokar City USA  I was born and raised in a junkyard and  I like junkyards  [Music]  this land was clear when I started  putting them in there  I wanted nature to take its course and  we just led to go wild  these cars come from other junkyards and  just individual people and they all wind  up here at old car city  [Music]  Ford Chevrolet Joe motors they land out  there in the forest rotting away  [Music]  we build things out of brushed out there  and it is a piece of art  [Laughter]  first came the grasses they came in  thick then smaller shrubs with them the  insects returned then the trees and with  the trees the monkeys and elephants here  at a sanctuary  we have over 300 acres a forest that we  have replanted and brought back to life  [Music]  my full name is Pamela Gayle multi-track  and I am co-founder with my husband of  size sanctuary trust it had always been  our dream to have a private forest  sanctuary for wildlife where they would  be protected when we first came here  most of the l